# Private instructions

This repo is public. Docs, packages, and n8n templates stay here. Binding agent instructions live in the sibling repo `webz-news-search-instructions`. Read them directly from that checkout; no symlink is required.

Follow the files below. Do not copy them into this repository.

New n8n templates start from `../webz-news-search-instructions/n8n-base-template.json`. Read that workflow and the linked `n8n-templates.md` before creating one. Do not copy the generator into this repo.

If a file reference does not load, read it from `../webz-news-search-instructions/` before editing. The checkout layout is one parent directory with `webz-news-search` and `webz-news-search-instructions` side by side.

